{
  "info": {
    "name": "IntelliDoc — Core API",
    "description": "Core API collection: auth, DMS (workspaces/modules/documents), extracted fields (Epic 3), chat + citations (Epic 8).\n\nRun **Login** first, then the numbered folders in order for the happy path.\n\nSeed user (after Flyway): `scripts/seed_users.sql`\nEmail: `jane.doe@company.com` / `password`\n\n**Fields:** document must be processed (`processingStatus=READY`) with extracted fields.\n\n**Chat:** documents in scope must be `READY` with indexed chunks/embeddings; `ai-service` must be running. `POST .../messages` returns SSE (`text/event-stream`) with `token`, `citation`, and `done` events.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /health",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('login 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.environment.set('token', json.token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /auth/me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Protected without token → 401",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/workspaces"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Workspaces (Story 1.1)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /workspaces",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.environment.set('workspaceId', json.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Q3 Vendor Contracts Review\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/workspaces"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /workspaces (second, for isolation tests)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.environment.set('workspaceBId', pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Governance\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/workspaces"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /workspaces",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/workspaces"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /workspaces/{workspaceId}",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PATCH /workspaces/{workspaceId} rename",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Q3 Vendor Contracts Review (renamed)\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST empty name → 400 WORKSPACE_INVALID_NAME",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/workspaces"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET unknown workspace → 404",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/workspaces/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000099"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Modules (Story 1.5)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /workspaces/{id}/modules",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.environment.set('moduleId', pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Contracts\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/modules"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST same name in workspace B (should 201)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.environment.set('moduleBId', pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Contracts\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceBId}}/modules"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST duplicate name in same workspace → 409",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Contracts\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/modules"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /workspaces/{id}/modules",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/modules"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PATCH /modules/{moduleId}",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Vendor Contracts\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/modules/{{moduleId}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Documents upload / list (Stories 1.2, 1.3, 1.6)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST upload two files",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('accepted', () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
                  "const docs = pm.response.json().documents || [];",
                  "if (docs.length) pm.environment.set('documentId', docs[0].id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "files",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Select a local .pdf (repeat the files field for a .docx)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "files",
                  "type": "file",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Enable and attach a second .docx"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/documents",
            "description": "Attach at least one .pdf or .docx to the `files` field. Expected 202, processingStatus UPLOADED."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST folder upload (relativePaths)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "files", "type": "file", "src": [] },
                { "key": "files", "type": "file", "src": [], "disabled": true },
                { "key": "relativePaths", "type": "text", "value": "Finance/Q3report.pdf" },
                { "key": "relativePaths", "type": "text", "value": "loose-memo.docx", "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/documents",
            "description": "First file should get moduleName Finance. A loose file with no folder segment stays moduleId null."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST mixed valid + .xlsx (xlsx in rejections)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "files", "type": "file", "src": [] },
                { "key": "files", "type": "file", "src": [], "description": "Attach a .xlsx — expect UNSUPPORTED_FILE_TYPE in rejections" }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/documents"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /workspaces/{id}/documents",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/documents",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["workspaces", "{{workspaceId}}", "documents"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET documents filtered by moduleId",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/documents?moduleId={{moduleId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET documents filtered by documentType",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/documents?documentType=contract",
            "description": "Empty until Epic 3 classifies. Use after you UPDATE document.document_type in Postgres."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /documents/{documentId}",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /documents/{documentId}/file (original)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}/file",
            "description": "Streams the original PDF/DOCX as uploaded. Use Send and Download in Postman, or open the blob in the UI. Independent of overview/summary."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Retry / module assign / archive (Stories 1.4, 1.5 AC3)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "PATCH /documents/{id}/module (same workspace)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"moduleId\": \"{{moduleId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}/module"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PATCH module from other workspace → 400 INVALID_MODULE_SCOPE",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"moduleId\": \"{{moduleBId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}/module"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /documents/{id}/retry (expect 409 unless FAILED)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}/retry",
            "description": "READY/UPLOADED → 409 INVALID_STATE_TRANSITION. To test success, run the SQL in the collection description to set processing_status = FAILED first."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE /documents/{id} archive",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE /modules/{moduleId} (docs become unassigned)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/modules/{{moduleId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE /workspaces/{id} archive",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}",
            "description": "Soft-archives. It will disappear from GET /workspaces."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Extracted fields (Epic 3)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /documents/{documentId}/fields",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('ok', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const fields = pm.response.json().fields || [];",
                  "if (fields.length) pm.environment.set('fieldId', fields[0].id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}/fields",
            "description": "Requires a READY document with extracted fields from the ingestion pipeline."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PATCH /fields/{fieldId} correct value",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"fieldValue\": \"45 days\",\n  \"status\": \"CORRECTED\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/fields/{{fieldId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /documents/{documentId}/fields/export (csv)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}/fields/export?format=csv",
            "description": "Downloads CSV attachment. Supported formats: csv, json."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /documents/{documentId}/fields/export (json)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}/fields/export?format=json"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET export invalid format → 400 FIELD_INVALID_EXPORT_FORMAT",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}/fields/export?format=xml"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE /fields/{fieldId} (soft remove)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/fields/{{fieldId}}",
            "description": "Sets status to REMOVED; field no longer appears in list/export."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "7. Chat sessions & messages (Epic 8)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /workspaces/{id}/chat-sessions (workspace scope)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.environment.set('chatSessionId', json.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"scope\": { \"type\": \"workspace\" },\n  \"title\": \"Ask about everything in this workspace\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/chat-sessions",
            "description": "Resolves scope to all non-archived documents in the workspace. Requires at least one READY document for chat to succeed."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /workspaces/{id}/chat-sessions (module scope)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"scope\": { \"type\": \"module\", \"moduleId\": \"{{moduleId}}\" },\n  \"title\": \"Ask about the Contracts module\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/chat-sessions"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /workspaces/{id}/chat-sessions (documents scope)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"scope\": { \"type\": \"documents\", \"documentIds\": [\"{{documentId}}\"] },\n  \"title\": \"Ask about one document\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/chat-sessions"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST cross-workspace document → 400 SCOPE_OUTSIDE_WORKSPACE",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"scope\": { \"type\": \"documents\", \"documentIds\": [\"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000099\"] }\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/chat-sessions",
            "description": "Use a documentId from another workspace to verify scope enforcement."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /chat-sessions/{sessionId}",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/chat-sessions/{{chatSessionId}}",
            "description": "Returns session metadata, resolvedDocumentIds, and full message history."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /chat-sessions/{sessionId}/messages (SSE)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('stream 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('sse content type', () => pm.response.to.have.header('Content-Type', /text\\/event-stream/i));",
                  "const body = pm.response.text();",
                  "pm.test('has done event', () => pm.expect(body).to.include('event:done'));",
                  "const match = body.match(/event:done\\r?\\n(?:data:|data: )(\\{[^\\r\\n]+\\})/);",
                  "if (match) {",
                  "  const done = JSON.parse(match[1]);",
                  "  if (done.messageId) pm.environment.set('messageId', done.messageId);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "text/event-stream" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"question\": \"What is the termination notice period?\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/chat-sessions/{{chatSessionId}}/messages",
            "description": "Streams answer via SSE. Events: `token` (partial text), `citation` (source excerpt), `done` (messageId, answerMode, confidence, isNotFound). Requires ai-service running with indexed documents."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST empty question → error event",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "text/event-stream" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"question\": \"\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/chat-sessions/{{chatSessionId}}/messages"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "8. Citations & source (Epic 8)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /messages/{messageId}/citations",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('ok', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const citations = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (Array.isArray(citations) && citations.length) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('citationId', citations[0].citationId);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/messages/{{messageId}}/citations",
            "description": "Run after POST .../messages. Returns [] when answer was not-found."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /citations/{citationId}/source",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/citations/{{citationId}}/source",
            "description": "Returns highlighted source passage for a citation (fileName, page, section, passage, highlight.start/end)."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "9. E2E Upload → Chat",
      "description": "Full happy path: upload → wait READY → chat with real AI answers. Requires CHAT_ANSWER_GENERATOR_MODE=http (Docker default) and ai-service running. Attach a .pdf or .docx to the upload step.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "9.1 Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('login 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.environment.set('token', pm.response.json().token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "9.2 Create workspace",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.environment.set('workspaceId', pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"E2E Chat Test Workspace\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/workspaces"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "9.3 Upload document",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('accepted', () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
                  "const docs = pm.response.json().documents || [];",
                  "pm.test('has document', () => pm.expect(docs.length).to.be.above(0));",
                  "if (docs.length) pm.environment.set('documentId', docs[0].id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "files",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Attach a local .pdf or .docx"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/documents"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "9.4 Poll until READY",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const maxAttempts = 60;",
                  "const delayMs = 5000;",
                  "const docId = pm.environment.get('documentId');",
                  "const token = pm.environment.get('token');",
                  "const baseUrl = pm.environment.get('baseUrl');",
                  "if (!docId) { throw new Error('Run 9.3 Upload first'); }",
                  "let status = 'UPLOADED';",
                  "for (let i = 0; i < maxAttempts && status !== 'READY' && status !== 'FAILED'; i++) {",
                  "  if (i > 0) { await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, delayMs)); }",
                  "  const res = await pm.sendRequest({",
                  "    url: baseUrl + '/documents/' + docId,",
                  "    method: 'GET',",
                  "    header: { Authorization: 'Bearer ' + token }",
                  "  });",
                  "  status = res.json().processingStatus;",
                  "  console.log('Poll attempt', i + 1, 'status=', status);",
                  "}",
                  "if (status === 'FAILED') { throw new Error('Document processing FAILED — check ai-service logs'); }",
                  "if (status !== 'READY') { throw new Error('Timed out waiting for READY (last status: ' + status + ')'); }"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('READY', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('processingStatus READY', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().processingStatus).to.eql('READY'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}",
            "description": "Pre-request script polls until READY (up to ~5 min). First run may be slow (embedding model download)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "9.5 Create chat session (workspace scope)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.environment.set('chatSessionId', pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"scope\": { \"type\": \"workspace\" },\n  \"title\": \"E2E upload chat test\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/chat-sessions"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "9.6 Ask question (SSE)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('stream 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.text();",
                  "pm.test('has token events', () => pm.expect(body).to.include('event:token'));",
                  "pm.test('has done event', () => pm.expect(body).to.include('event:done'));",
                  "const match = body.match(/event:done\\r?\\n(?:data:|data: )(\\{[^\\r\\n]+\\})/);",
                  "if (match) {",
                  "  const done = JSON.parse(match[1]);",
                  "  if (done.messageId) pm.environment.set('messageId', done.messageId);",
                  "  pm.test('not stub notice period', () => {",
                  "    if (!done.isNotFound) pm.expect(body).to.not.include('30 days written notice');",
                  "  });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "text/event-stream" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"question\": \"What is this document about?\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/chat-sessions/{{chatSessionId}}/messages"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "9.7 GET session (verify assistant message)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/chat-sessions/{{chatSessionId}}",
            "description": "Check messages[] for assistant content matching the SSE stream."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "9.8 GET citations + source",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "GET /messages/{messageId}/citations",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "const citations = pm.response.json();",
                      "if (Array.isArray(citations) && citations.length) {",
                      "  pm.environment.set('citationId', citations[0].citationId);",
                      "}"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/messages/{{messageId}}/citations"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "GET /citations/{citationId}/source",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/citations/{{citationId}}/source"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
